-- a meso compound: an automorphism of the graph that carries the orientation to its reflection. The
-- molecule has stereocentres and is nevertheless identical to its mirror image, which is why
-- handedness cannot be read off a count of centres.
Meso : Oriented → Type 0
Meso S = (a : Auto (or-mol S)) × ((x : mol-atoms (or-mol S)) → or-hand S (auto-fun (or-mol S) a x) ≡ hand-flip (or-hand S x))
